WEBVTT

00:00:28.792 --> 00:00:30.792
(TOILET FLUSHING)

00:01:11.672 --> 00:01:13.272
Lucy.

00:01:14.432 --> 00:01:16.152
Where are you?

00:01:18.912 --> 00:01:20.072
Boo!

00:01:27.272 --> 00:01:28.992
Lucy.

00:01:31.072 --> 00:01:33.672
Hope you're not afraid of the dark.

00:01:39.592 --> 00:01:40.912
Lucy?

00:01:47.032 --> 00:01:48.392
Lucy?

00:01:50.192 --> 00:01:51.432
Lucy!

00:01:52.192 --> 00:01:53.192
(GROANS)

00:02:10.232 --> 00:02:11.712
Lucy.

00:02:13.272 --> 00:02:14.952
Where are you?

00:02:16.712 --> 00:02:17.992
Lucy.

00:02:19.512 --> 00:02:21.592
I think I believe you now.

00:02:47.752 --> 00:02:49.112
Lucy.

00:02:59.952 --> 00:03:01.552
(BELLS JINGLING)

00:03:06.192 --> 00:03:07.392
Lucy?

00:03:10.872 --> 00:03:12.992
(SHOUTING)

00:03:27.752 --> 00:03:29.472
(GROWLING)

00:03:36.992 --> 00:03:38.072
Leave me alone!

00:03:38.232 --> 00:03:39.792
WHITE WITCH: What is it now,
Ginarrbrik?

00:03:39.952 --> 00:03:42.152
Make him let me go!
I didn't do anything wrong!

00:03:42.312 --> 00:03:44.432
How dare you address
the Queen of Narnia?

00:03:44.632 --> 00:03:45.832
I didn't know!

00:03:45.992 --> 00:03:48.992
-You will know her better hereafter!
-Wait!

00:03:59.952 --> 00:04:02.432
What is your name, Son of Adam?

00:04:04.272 --> 00:04:05.432
Edmund.

00:04:05.592 --> 00:04:08.912
And how, Edmund,
did you come to enter my dominion?

00:04:09.992 --> 00:04:13.512
I'm not sure.
I was just following my sister.

00:04:13.672 --> 00:04:17.312
-Your sister? How many are you?
-Four.

00:04:17.992 --> 00:04:20.472
Lucy's the only one
that's been here before.

00:04:20.632 --> 00:04:23.952
She said she met some faun
called Tumnus.

00:04:24.712 --> 00:04:27.352
Peter and Susan didn't believe her.
I didn't either.

00:04:27.512 --> 00:04:31.912
Edmund, you look so cold.
Will you come and sit with me?

00:04:48.192 --> 00:04:51.112
Now, how about
something hot to drink?

00:04:52.312 --> 00:04:55.152
Yes, please, Your Majesty.

00:05:13.232 --> 00:05:15.032
Your drink, sire.

00:05:15.872 --> 00:05:17.792
How did you do that?

00:05:17.952 --> 00:05:20.192
I can make anything you like.

00:05:20.992 --> 00:05:22.312
Can you make me taller?

00:05:22.472 --> 00:05:23.712
(CHUCKLING)

00:05:24.232 --> 00:05:26.392
Anything you'd like to eat.

00:05:28.152 --> 00:05:29.832
Turkish delight?

